@Identity.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### Da li servis radi i da li vidi bazu
GET {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Registracija: uspešna (201). Drugi put sa istim mejlom vraća 409.
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pera@example.com",
  "password": "Lozinka123",
  "firstName": "Pera",
  "lastName": "Perić",
  "role": "Buyer"
}

### Registracija: slaba lozinka (400)
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mika@example.com",
  "password": "lozinka",
  "firstName": "Mika",
  "lastName": "Mikić",
  "role": "Seller"
}

### Registracija: nepostojeća uloga (400)
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "laza@example.com",
  "password": "Lozinka123",
  "firstName": "Laza",
  "lastName": "Lazić",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### Registracija: nedostaju polja i loš mejl (400)
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nije-mejl",
  "password": "Lozinka123"
}

### Prijava: uspešna (200, vraća token). Korisnik mora prvo biti registrovan.
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pera@example.com",
  "password": "Lozinka123"
}

### Prijava: pogrešna lozinka (401)
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pera@example.com",
  "password": "Pogresna123"
}

### Prijava: nepostojeći mejl (401, isti odgovor kao za pogrešnu lozinku)
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "niko@example.com",
  "password": "Lozinka123"
}
